.TP
.B \-\-allow\-ip
Only answer this address or network. Repeat to allow several. Default: Sentinel.UNSET.
.TP
.B \-\-trusted\-proxy
Believe forwarding headers from this peer. Declare the proxy that terminates TLS so the session cookie is issued with Secure. Default: Sentinel.UNSET.
